00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:56.530
there's one or two, I don't want to give it away, but Dwight Angela wedding moments that
有一两个片段，我不想剧透，但关于德怀特和安吉拉婚礼的瞬间，

237
00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:03.510
I want to ask you about, I guess I did just give it away if you're watching it for the
我想问问你，我想如果大家是第一次看的话，我确实刚刚剧透了。

238
00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.130
first time.
第一次看。

239
00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:04.910
Yeah.
是啊。

240
00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.090
Some of those episodes.
其中几集。

241
00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:12.750
Nate, I thank you so much for coming on office ladies and sharing your story with us.
内特，非常感谢你来到《办公室女士》节目并与我们分享你的故事。

242
00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:17.710
You know, in my book that I wrote, which is the actor's life, a survival guide.
你知道，在我写的书《演员的生活：生存指南》里，

243
00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.910
It's like advice for aspiring actors.
那里面给有抱负的演员提供了一些建议。

244
00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:26.270
You were kind enough to let me share your story in that book as well, because I think
你很慷慨地让我把你的故事也写进了书里，因为我觉得

245
00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:34.490
like there's a lot of people who are anywhere in the world and they have these artistic things
世界上有很多人，无论身在何处，他们内心都有想要表达的艺术追求。

246
00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.390
inside of them that they want to express.
而我认为你就是一个很好的榜样，你只是去做了，去表达了，甚至没有

247
00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:43.390
And I think you're such a great example of just doing it, just expressing it for no even
预设什么目标，仅仅是因为这个世界需要欢笑、艺术家和创造力。

248
00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:49.410
known goal, just because the world needs laughter and artists and creativity.
然后这彻底改变了你的人生。

249
00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.770
And then it completely transformed your life.
我真的非常喜欢你的故事。

250
00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.430
But I just love your story so much.
我真的非常喜欢你的故事。

251
00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.650
I think it's so inspiring.
我觉得这太鼓舞人心了。

252
00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.090
Oh, thank you.
噢，谢谢你。

253
00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.410
I really appreciate that.
我真的很感激。

254
00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:12.710
It's I truly, truly believe that if you do good work, if you have a point of view and you're
我真心、真心相信，如果你工作出色，如果你有自己的观点，并且你

255
00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:22.950
truly interested and passionate about your take on comedy or drama or anything or enacting,
对喜剧、戏剧或任何表演形式真正感兴趣并充满热情，

256
00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:31.090
I wholeheartedly believe that the cream rises to the top and that people will take notice,
我全心全意地相信，金子总会发光，人们会注意到的，

257
00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.670
especially nowadays.
尤其是在当今时代。

258
00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:41.290
There's so many different ways to show your talent out there and show your creativity.
现在有太多不同的方式来展示你的才华和创造力了。

259
00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:48.450
Don't get disheartened by all the floxam and jutsam that is out there.
不要被外界那些乱七八糟的杂音所打击。

260
00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:53.310
Just keep doing what you find to be interesting and unique.
坚持做你觉得有趣且独特的事情就好。

261
00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.270
And hopefully others will find that to be the case.
希望别人也会有同感。

262
00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.490
Yeah, I so agree.
是啊，我非常赞同。

263
00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.190
I so agree.
我非常赞同。

264
00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:03.930
It's not just the idea, but it's a call to action if you have it to try it, you know,
这不仅仅是一个想法，更是一种行动号召，如果你有想法就去尝试，你知道的，

265
00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:05.350
and put it out there.
然后把它展示出来。

266
00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:06.170
Absolutely.
绝对是这样。

267
00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:11.290
Mark, is there anything that you're working on now that we could share with our listeners
马克，你现在有什么正在进行的项目可以分享给我们的听众，

268
00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.150
